{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{TAGLINE}}</title>
<meta name="description" content="Aromatherapy services that may support personal balance and comfort.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="site-wrap">
<header class="site-header">
<a class="logo" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
<nav class="nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
<ul>
<li><a href="/services.html">Offerings</a></li>
<li><a href="/blends.html">Formulas</a></li>
<li><a href="/shop.html">Boutique</a></li>
<li><a href="/pricing.html">Investment</a></li>
<li><a href="/about.html">Story</a></li>
<li><a href="/book.html">Reserve</a></li>
<li><a href="/contact.html">Reach</a></li>
</ul>
</nav>
<a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
<button class="nav-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-list">Menu</button>
</header>

<main class="content">
<section class="hero reveal" aria-label="Intro">
<div class="hero-inner">
<h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
<p class="tagline">{{TAGLINE}}</p>
<p class="lead">Personal scent work and guided sessions that may support more grounded minutes and clearer pauses in your day.</p>
<div class="hero-actions">
<a class="primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
<a class="secondary" href="/about.html">Explore the method</a>
</div>

<div class="planner compact" id="planner-hero" aria-labelledby="planner-hero-label">
<h2 id="planner-hero-label">Quick Session Planner</h2>
<form>
<label>Focus
<select name="focus">
<option>Calm</option>
<option>Uplift</option>
<option>Grounding</option>
<option>Sleep</option>
</select>
</label>
<label>Length
<select name="length">
<option>5 minutes</option>
<option>15 minutes</option>
<option>30 minutes</option>
</select>
</label>
<button type="button" class="plan-btn" data-target="planner-hero">Create Plan</button>
</form>
<div class="result" aria-live="polite"></div>
<button class="copy-btn" data-target="planner-hero">Copy Summary</button>
</div>

</div>
</section>

<section class="pillars reveal" aria-label="Approach">
<div class="grid">
<article>
<h3>Foundations</h3>
<p>Safety-forward guidance, intentional composition, and clear directions on use so you can practice responsibly at home.</p>
</article>
<article>
<h3>Formats</h3>
<p>Single consultations, short guided sessions, and take-home blends with usage notes that may support daily routines.</p>
</article>
<article>
<h3>Care</h3>
<p>Practical dilution, patch testing, and specific advice for pregnancy and pet safety are included in every plan.</p>
</article>
</div>
</section>

<section class="myths reveal" aria-label="Myths and truths">
<h2>Common Misconceptions</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Myth:</strong> Essential oils are risk-free. <strong>Truth:</strong> Reactions vary; patch testing and correct dilution are important.</li>
<li><strong>Myth:</strong> Aromatherapy is a medical treatment. <strong>Truth:</strong> It may support comfort but is not a substitute for medical care.</li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="case-notes reveal" aria-label="Session examples">
<h2>Session Notes</h2>
<div class="note">
<h4>Morning Ground</h4>
<p>10-minute inhalation support with an earth-forward formula. May support focus before starting a demanding day.</p>
</div>
<div class="note">
<h4>Bedside Calm</h4>
<p>15-minute soft-floral inhalation with low dilution. Patch test recommended; consult guidance for pregnancy.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="planner-full reveal" aria-label="Session planner full">
<h2>Session Planner</h2>
<div id="planner" class="planner">
<form id="planner-form">
<label>What would you like to support?<input name="goal" placeholder="e.g., unwind before sleep"></label>
<label>Preferred tone
<select name="tone">
<option>Calming</option>
<option>Bright</option>
<option>Grounding</option>
<option>Neutral</option>
</select>
</label>
<label>Session length
<select name="duration">
<option value="5">5</option>
<option value="10">10</option>
<option value="15">15</option>
<option value="30">30</option>
</select> minutes</label>
<label>Skin sensitivity
<select name="sensitivity">
<option>None</option>
<option>Mild</option>
<option>Sensitive</option>
</select></label>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="pregnancy"> Pregnancy or breastfeeding considerations</label>
<label><input type="checkbox" name="pets"> Pets in household</label>
<button type="button" id="build-plan">Build Plan</button>
</form>
<pre id="plan-output" readonly aria-live="polite"></pre>
<div class="planner-actions">
<button id="copy-plan">Copy Summary</button>
<button id="download-plan">Download .txt</button>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="faq reveal" aria-label="FAQ">
<h2>FAQ</h2>
<dl>
<dt>Are essential oils safe for everyone?</dt>
<dd>Individual sensitivity varies. Perform a patch test and follow dilution guidelines. Consult a health provider for pregnancy, breastfeeding, or medical concerns.</dd>
<dt>What dilution do you recommend?</dt>
<dd>Typical topical dilution suggestions range from 0.5–3% depending on age and sensitivity. Use lower concentrations for children or sensitive skin.</dd>
<dt>What about pets?</dt>
<dd>Some oils can affect animals. Keep blends away from pets, ventilate spaces, and consult a veterinarian when in doubt.</dd>
</dl>
</section>

<section class="cta reveal">
<h2>Begin a focused session</h2>
<a class="primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
</section>

</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
<div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
<div>Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
</footer>
</div>
<script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
